{"id": "532851", "name": "אי-שוויון צ'בישב – גבול P(X_n > tn) כש-Var = n, בחירה מרשימה", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>תהא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left(X_n\\right)_{n=1}^\\infty\\)</span> סדרה של משתנים מקריים כך ש <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X_n]=0\\)</span> וכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}[X_n]=n\\)</span> לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle{ \\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\mathbb{P}\\left[X_n&gt; tn \\right] }\\)</span> לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t&gt;0\\)</span>.</p><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">(<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> מסמלת כאן את פונקציית ההתפלגות של משתנה מקרי נורמלי תיקני).</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "checkbox", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "LaTeXdisplaystyle"}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosi